flowchart LR
    CLIENT[Parent Android / Teacher web] --> API[FastAPI + application use cases]
    API --> RULE[StoryRun domain<br/>one adult + one child per active run]
    RULE --> DB[(PostgreSQL<br/>run state, approvals, outbox)]
